COMANDOS ESSENCIAIS DO LARAVEL

1.  Inicialização do Projeto

composer create-project laravel/laravel nome-do-projeto
php artisan key:generate
php artisan migrate

2.  Servidor Local

-   php artisan serve

3.  Rotas

-   php artisan route:list

4.  Controllers

-   php artisan make:controller NomeController
-   php artisan make:controller NomeController –resource

5.  Models

-   php artisan make:model Nome
-   php artisan make:model Nome -m
-   php artisan make:model Nome -mcr

6.  Migrations

-   php artisan make:migration create_nome_table
-   php artisan migrate
-   php artisan migrate:rollback
-   php artisan migrate:fresh

7.  Seeders e Factories

-   php artisan make:seeder NomeSeeder
-   php artisan db:seed
-   php artisan migrate:fresh –seed

8.  Tinker

-   php artisan tinker

9.  Cache

-   php artisan cache:clear
-   php artisan route:clear
-   php artisan view:clear
-   php artisan config:clear

10. Views / Blade

-   php artisan vendor:publish

11. Jobs, Events, Mail

-   php artisan make:job NomeJob
-   php artisan make:event NomeEvent
-   php artisan make:mail NomeMail

12. Outros

-   php artisan –version
-   tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log
